 "Hello again! I was hoping to request a tomboy delinquent/ヤンキー/foul-mouthed/粗暴 (whatever term works lol) voice for my character \"Ryuka\" (https://imgur.com/a/7oOFIkl). She's a very tough and strong girl who speaks similarly to delinquent or sukeban anime characters like 纏 流子 from kill la kill, or 空条 徐倫 from Jojos Bizarre Adventure... etc. Her voice is somewhat deep but not as deep or boyish as Ano. She may seem mean but she really cares for those who are close to her. \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n【Request information】\n①\n「はあぁ？何ジロジロ見てんだ、お前。あー……なんだ、お前か。」\n\n②\n「オレはリュウカ！邪魔すんなよ、踏み潰されてぇのか？」\n\n➂\n「チビの世話とかめんどくせぇなぁ。ほら、靴ん中入って黙ってろ。ちょぉ～～～～うるせぇんだよ！！」\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nThank you! I hope there are no mistakes. Feel free to adlib, remove, or add lines as you see fit if you think it'll improve the request. Your voice is really awesome! I would not mind being a regular customer lol. Ganbatte!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/7oOFIkl", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@inshbK/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1943264738579992576%2F18R5OQZB.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7371556ae41d547b1e912bf00f8c4fc8", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1943264738579992576%2F18R5OQZB.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7371556ae41d547b1e912bf00f8c4fc8, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1943264738579992576%2F18R5OQZB.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=62f